  "request": "Goal: Make gate phase transitions failure-atomic. Scope: src/flow/lib/run-gate.js, gate phase inference and transition ordering, plus fault-injection and retry coverage at validation, agent execution, and artifact-write boundaries. Required behavior: commit transitions only after validation and gate judgment succeed; preserve persisted pre-transition step state on every failure; model rewind as an explicit transition; apply a successful transition exactly once; retries must not duplicate findings or artifacts. Out of scope: unrelated flow behavior and compatibility code.",
